				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-weight:bold"&gt;Based on long-term firm contracts in place on September 1, 2022, the settlement resulted in incremental reductions in revenues of $2.8 million in 2024 and $1.8 million in 2025. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-weight:bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
