&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 150%; font-size: 5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The above loans and facilities require the Partnership to maintain compliance with certain restrictive covenants relating to, among other things, certain ratios of indebtedness to total capitalization, and debt service coverage, as defined in the credit agreements and bond indentures. The Partnership is in compliance with these covenants as of year ended December 31, 20&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;25,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;through the first six months &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;of 20&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;26&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 150%; font-size: 5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table style="border-collapse: collapse;" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 468pt; border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 1pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: top;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; font-variant: small-caps; letter-spacing: -0.6pt;"&gt;Note 3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; font-variant: small-caps; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 150%; font-size: 3pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; font-variant: small-caps;"&gt;Commitments and Contingencies:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 3pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 3pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 13.5pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Regulatory Proceedings&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;In anticipation of the Partnership&amp;#8217;s obligation to file a Section 4 rate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;case no later than September 1, 2022, the Partnership entered into discussions with the RP16-301 and the RP19-445 interested parties (2022 Settlement Parties).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; These discussions resulted in an agreement in principal resolving all rate case issues (2022 Settlement).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; The 2022 Settlement was filed with the FERC &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;and approved by order dated August 31, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;2022, with new rates being placed into effect September 1, 2022.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; Pursuant to the 2022 Settlement, there &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;was&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;rate moratorium wherein no new firm &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;recourse rates c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;ould&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; be placed into effect on the Partnership&amp;#8217;s mainline or Eastchester facilities until September 1, 2026.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; Following the conclusion of the moratorium, if no rate case is filed or if no new rate settlement is reached, the Partnership must file a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;section 4 rate case no later than September 1, 2027.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;During the period of the moratorium, Iroquois reduced its rates in three step-downs as follows:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style="text-align: center;"&gt;
&lt;table style="margin-right: auto; margin-left: auto; border: 1pt solid #000000; border-collapse: collapse;" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 87.7pt; border-right-style: solid; border-right-width: 1pt; border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 1pt; padding-right: 4.9pt; padding-left: 4.9pt; vertical-align: top;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Service&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 71.3pt; border-right-style: solid; border-right-width: 1pt; border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 1pt; padding-right: 4.9pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: top;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Pre-settlement Rates&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 84.65pt; border-right-style: solid; border-right-width: 1pt; border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 1pt; padding-right: 4.9pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: top;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Effective 9/1/22&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
