    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH9CB72F4763D8812D2889F58806F7828E" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Page 521a-M1, Line 4, column (c):

The quantities reported in this column are a pro-rata apportionment of the quantity reported on this page and line in column (e) based on the ratio of scheduled transportation quantities associated with negotiated rates and the total scheduled transportation quantities for the applicable period.

This applies to Pages 521a-M1, 521b-M1, 521a-M2, 521b-M2, 521a-M3, and 521b-M3.</div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH8315FF75943E15674F35B3AA8B824452" xlink:to="HH9CB72F4763D8812D2889F58806F7828E" order="1" />
