    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH196A5E72D4071923B821170B6E55007B" xlink:label="HH196A5E72D4071923B821170B6E55007B" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH175149B08C8E6AFF9BF18EDC6B06FDF3" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Iroquois charges fuel-in-kind based on Monthly Fuel &amp; Losses Retention (F&amp;LR) Factors.  Over/under collections of natural gas are trued-up through adjustments to the F&amp;LR Factors that Iroquois charges its customers in future months pursuant to Section 36 of the General Terms and Conditions of Iroquois&#8217; FERC Gas Tariff.

As a result, no cash is transferred between Iroquois and Iroquois&#8217; shippers for fuel and measurement variances including Lost and Unaccounted for Gas.

Iroquois has valued the gas reported in months 1, 2, and 3 using the PAL and HUB Credit Index Price in effect as of May 1, 2026, June 1, 2026, and July 1, 2026 respectively.</div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH196A5E72D4071923B821170B6E55007B" xlink:to="HH175149B08C8E6AFF9BF18EDC6B06FDF3" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH2EA70179D4D076CC24C96626E7BC9666" xlink:label="HH2EA70179D4D076CC24C96626E7BC9666" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHB7CE6C75023DB3C1E0160AE2D1E63FA9" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Page 521-M3, Line 21, column (e)

Line 21 data is comprised of the following:

